  "title": "Intel Announces Leadership Appointment to Strengthen Customer Engagement and Accelerate Growth",
  "summary": "SANTA CLARA, Calif., August 7, 2026 – Intel Corporation today announced the appointment of Dean Jarnac as executive vice president and chief sales officer. Jarnac will lead Intel's global sales organization— strengthening Intel's customer relationships and go-to-market execution across its product portfolio, including client, data center, AI, networking, and ASICs.“Customer focus and execution are central to Intel's strategy and … The post Intel Announces Leadership Appointment to Strengthen Customer Engagement and Accelerate Growth appeared first on Newsroom .",
